WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.822
The diagnosis dashboard is a good materialized-view
example Its

00:00:05.848 --> 00:00:13.204
grain and measures are stable The summary may be
read frequently And

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:18.995
leadership can tolerate a documented refresh
interval The materialized

00:00:19.021 --> 00:00:23.706
view becomes a small data product with both a schema
contract and a freshness contract
